# Keep APP_MAP.md Current

After any change that adds, removes, renames or moves a page, tab, section, field, filter, column or data source, update [docs/APP_MAP.md](docs/APP_MAP.md) in the same commit.

APP_MAP.md lists, for every page and every tab in the school detail view:
- the exact name shown in the UI
- each section in order, with the exact heading
- each field shown: UI label, stored field name, and where the value comes from (which import file or API)
- list page filters, sort options and Columns picker options

Keep it plain and factual. No plans, only what exists now.
